aws-lambda-cpp
------------------------------------------
C++ implementation of the AWS Lambda runtime

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.7.0-0.618.g8f145421c964
  libaws-lambda-runtime-devel-1.0.1-1bl1
  libaws-lambda-runtime0-1.0.1-1bl1
  libcurl4-8.22.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.7-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.3-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libcurl-devel-8.22.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/awslabs/aws-lambda-cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/awslabs/aws-lambda-cpp/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack aws-lambda-cpp-1.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./aws-lambda-cpp-1.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/aws-lambda-cpp-1.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/aws-lambda-cpp-1.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libaws-lambda-runtime0-1.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libaws-lambda-runtime-devel-1.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(aws-lambda-cpp)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/aws-lambda-cpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/aws-lambda-cpp/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/aws-lambda-cpp/NOTICE
  /usr/share/doc/aws-lambda-cpp/README.md

(libaws-lambda-runtime0)
  /usr/bin/cygaws-lambda-runtime-0.dll

(libaws-lambda-runtime-devel)
  /usr/include/aws/http/response.h
  /usr/include/aws/lambda-runtime/outcome.h
  /usr/include/aws/lambda-runtime/runtime.h
  /usr/include/aws/lambda-runtime/version.h
  /usr/include/aws/logging/logging.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/aws-lambda-runtime/aws-lambda-runtime-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/aws-lambda-runtime/aws-lambda-runtime-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/aws-lambda-runtime/aws-lambda-runtime-targets-release.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/aws-lambda-runtime/aws-lambda-runtime-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/aws-lambda-runtime/packager
  /usr/lib/libaws-lambda-runtime.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/aws-lambda-cpp.pc

